# Fixture: local-playing. Recording is process state, not model state, so it is
# reached rather than seeded. On a machine with no input device the desktop
# reports voice capture unavailable and the assertion below fails honestly.
settle 30
assert snap voice-available == true
act voice-begin
settle 20
assert snap recording == true
assert event recording true
capture recording
act voice-cancel
settle 15
assert snap recording == false
capture recording-cancelled
log recording complete
